(556,350,$mw$2A1F723215C227CB01BEA6F0FB66724208D17F1952D365E1A9AF86A95EC27ACF$mw$,$mw$af024f7f70cb1b1321eed338306f718b$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":350,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":36,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"أوجد نهاية \\(a_n=\\frac{3}{n+1}\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\).","TitleEn":"Find limit of \\(a_n=\\frac{3}{n+1}\\) as n tends to infinity.","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد نهاية \\(a_n=\\frac{3}{n+1}\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Find limit of \\(a_n=\\frac{3}{n+1}\\) as n tends to infinity.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: الكسر ذو البسط الثابت والمقام الذي يزداد إلى ما لا نهاية يتقارب إلى الصفر. للمتتالية aₙ = 3/(n+1)، لأي ε > 0 نختار n أكبر من 3/ε، عندها 0 < 3/(n+1) < ε. إذن lim(aₙ) عندما n → ∞ يساوي 0.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: A constant divided by a denominator increasing without bound has limit zero. For aₙ = 3/(n+1), given any ε > 0 choose n > 3/ε. Then 0 < 3/(n+1) < ε, proving lim(n→∞) aₙ = 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1389,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1390,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"+\\infty","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1391,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1392,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"راقب سلوك الحد عندما تكبر رتبة المتتالية.","En":"Examine how the term behaves as its index increases."},{"Ar":"قارن الكسر بكمية تتناقص إلى الصفر عندما يكبر المقام.","En":"Compare the fraction with a quantity tending to zero as its denominator grows."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد نهاية \\(a_n=\\frac{3}{n+1}\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\).","En":"Find limit of \\(a_n=\\frac{3}{n+1}\\) as n tends to infinity."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $3$ حد موجب ثابت، بينما يمكن جعل الكسر أصغر من أي عدد موجب بتكبير المقام.","En":"Choice $3$ is a fixed positive value, but the fraction can be made smaller than any positive number by increasing the denominator."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"خلط ازدياد المقام مع ازدياد الكسر؛ زيادة المقام تخفض كسر البسط الثابت.","En":"Confuses growth of the denominator with growth of the fraction; a fixed numerator gives a decreasing fraction."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"+\\infty"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $1$ حد موجب ثابت، بينما يمكن جعل الكسر أصغر من أي عدد موجب بتكبير المقام.","En":"Choice $1$ is a fixed positive value, but the fraction can be made smaller than any positive number by increasing the denominator."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد نهاية \\(a_n=\\frac{3}{n+1}\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\).","En":"Find limit of \\(a_n=\\frac{3}{n+1}\\) as n tends to infinity."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"البسط ثابت والمقام يزداد بلا حد.","En":"The numerator stays fixed as the denominator grows without bound."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"البسط $3$ ثابت موجب والمقام $n+1$ يزداد بلا حد.","En":"The numerator $3$ is positive and fixed while $n+1$ grows without bound."},{"Ar":"لـ $n\\ge1$ لدينا $0<\\frac{3}{n+1}\\le\\frac{3}n$؛ الطرف الأعلى يقترب من الصفر.","En":"For $n\\ge1$, $0<\\frac{3}{n+1}\\le\\frac{3}n$; the upper bound tends to zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بنهاية المتتالية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the sequence limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{c}{n+1}=0\\quad(c>0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3}{n+1}=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3}{n+1}=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"لكل $\\varepsilon>0$ يكفي اختيار $n>3/\\varepsilon$ كي يكون الحد أصغر من $\\varepsilon$.","En":"For each $\\varepsilon>0$, choosing $n>3/\\varepsilon$ makes the term less than $\\varepsilon$."}},"TrackIds":[13,20],"CategoryId":36,"PrimarySkillId":72,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"راقب سلوك الحد عندما تكبر رتبة المتتالية.","En":"Examine how the term behaves as its index increases."},{"Ar":"قارن الكسر بكمية تتناقص إلى الصفر عندما يكبر المقام.","En":"Compare the fraction with a quantity tending to zero as its denominator grows."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"البسط ثابت والمقام يزداد بلا حد.","En":"The numerator stays fixed as the denominator grows without bound."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"البسط $3$ ثابت موجب والمقام $n+1$ يزداد بلا حد.","En":"The numerator $3$ is positive and fixed while $n+1$ grows without bound."},{"Ar":"لـ $n\\ge1$ لدينا $0<\\frac{3}{n+1}\\le\\frac{3}n$؛ الطرف الأعلى يقترب من الصفر.","En":"For $n\\ge1$, $0<\\frac{3}{n+1}\\le\\frac{3}n$; the upper bound tends to zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بنهاية المتتالية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the sequence limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{c}{n+1}=0\\quad(c>0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3}{n+1}=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{3}{n+1}=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"لكل $\\varepsilon>0$ يكفي اختيار $n>3/\\varepsilon$ كي يكون الحد أصغر من $\\varepsilon$.","En":"For each $\\varepsilon>0$, choosing $n>3/\\varepsilon$ makes the term less than $\\varepsilon$."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $3$ حد موجب ثابت، بينما يمكن جعل الكسر أصغر من أي عدد موجب بتكبير المقام.","En":"Choice $3$ is a fixed positive value, but the fraction can be made smaller than any positive number by increasing the denominator."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"خلط ازدياد المقام مع ازدياد الكسر؛ زيادة المقام تخفض كسر البسط الثابت.","En":"Confuses growth of the denominator with growth of the fraction; a fixed numerator gives a decreasing fraction."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $1$ حد موجب ثابت، بينما يمكن جعل الكسر أصغر من أي عدد موجب بتكبير المقام.","En":"Choice $1$ is a fixed positive value, but the fraction can be made smaller than any positive number by increasing the denominator."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$البسط ثابت والمقام يزداد بلا حد.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{c}{n+1}=0\quad(c>0)$

1. البسط $3$ ثابت موجب والمقام $n+1$ يزداد بلا حد.

2. لـ $n\ge1$ لدينا $0<\frac{3}{n+1}\le\frac{3}n$؛ الطرف الأعلى يقترب من الصفر.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{3}{n+1}=0$

$0$ بلا وحدة قياس

لكل $\varepsilon>0$ يكفي اختيار $n>3/\varepsilon$ كي يكون الحد أصغر من $\varepsilon$.

لا تخلط الحد الأول بنهاية المتتالية.$mw$,$mw$The numerator stays fixed as the denominator grows without bound.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{c}{n+1}=0\quad(c>0)$

1. The numerator $3$ is positive and fixed while $n+1$ grows without bound.

2. For $n\ge1$, $0<\frac{3}{n+1}\le\frac{3}n$; the upper bound tends to zero.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{3}{n+1}=0$

$0$ Dimensionless

For each $\varepsilon>0$, choosing $n>3/\varepsilon$ makes the term less than $\varepsilon$.

Do not confuse the first term with the sequence limit.$mw$),
(557,351,$mw$839605571296AA658B2860DF629996524E8FB16442C97B2A34609F8C3E51C51F$mw$,$mw$2f0d0cb01cd0a028e6cfbee6a2d27702$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":351,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":36,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما نهاية \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{3})^n\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\)؟","TitleEn":"Find the limit of \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{3})^n\\) as n tends to infinity.","QuestionTextAr":"ما نهاية \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{3})^n\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the limit of \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{3})^n\\) as n tends to infinity.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: إذا كان |r| < 1 فإن المتتالية الهندسية rⁿ تتقارب إلى الصفر. في حالتنا r = 1/3، وهو بين الصفر والواحد؛ بالتالي aₙ = (1/3)ⁿ = 1/3ⁿ. ومع زيادة n يكبر المقام 3ⁿ بلا حد، لذا lim(aₙ) = 0.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: For a geometric sequence rⁿ with |r| < 1, the terms tend to zero. Here r = 1/3 lies strictly between 0 and 1, so aₙ = (1/3)ⁿ = 1/3ⁿ. As n increases, 3ⁿ grows without bound; hence lim aₙ = 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1393,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"+\\infty","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1394,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1395,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1396,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{3}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"راقب سلوك الحد عندما تكبر رتبة المتتالية.","En":"Examine how the term behaves as its index increases."},{"Ar":"تحقق أن القيمة المطلقة للأساس أصغر من واحد.","En":"Check that the absolute base is below one."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما نهاية \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{3})^n\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\)؟","En":"Find the limit of \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{3})^n\\) as n tends to infinity."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"عامل الأساس كأنه أكبر من واحد مع أنه أصغر من واحد.","En":"Treats the base as greater than one although it is less than one."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"+\\infty"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"خلط الحد عند الأس صفر مع النهاية عند ازدياد الأس.","En":"Confuses the zeroth power with the limit at increasing exponent."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"أعطى قيمة الأساس أو الحد الأول بدلاً من نهاية القوى.","En":"Returns the base or first term instead of the limit of the powers."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{3}"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما نهاية \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{3})^n\\) عندما \\(n\\to\\infty\\)؟","En":"Find the limit of \\(a_n=(\\frac{1}{3})^n\\) as n tends to infinity."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قوى نسبة مطلقة أصغر من واحد تؤول إلى الصفر.","En":"Powers of a ratio with magnitude below one tend to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس $r=\\frac1{3}$ موجب وأصغر من الواحد.","En":"The base $r=\\frac1{3}$ is positive and less than one."},{"Ar":"كل حد ينتج عن ضرب سابقه في $\\frac1{3}$، ولذلك تتناقص القوى إلى الصفر.","En":"Each term multiplies the preceding term by $\\frac1{3}$, so powers decrease toward zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بنهاية المتتالية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the sequence limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}r^n=0\\quad(|r|<1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{3}\\right)^n=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{3}\\right)^n=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$0<\\left(\\frac1{3}\\right)^n\\le\\frac1{2^n}\\to0$","En":"$0<\\left(\\frac1{3}\\right)^n\\le\\frac1{2^n}\\to0$"}},"TrackIds":[13,20],"CategoryId":36,"PrimarySkillId":72,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"راقب سلوك الحد عندما تكبر رتبة المتتالية.","En":"Examine how the term behaves as its index increases."},{"Ar":"تحقق أن القيمة المطلقة للأساس أصغر من واحد.","En":"Check that the absolute base is below one."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قوى نسبة مطلقة أصغر من واحد تؤول إلى الصفر.","En":"Powers of a ratio with magnitude below one tend to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الأساس $r=\\frac1{3}$ موجب وأصغر من الواحد.","En":"The base $r=\\frac1{3}$ is positive and less than one."},{"Ar":"كل حد ينتج عن ضرب سابقه في $\\frac1{3}$، ولذلك تتناقص القوى إلى الصفر.","En":"Each term multiplies the preceding term by $\\frac1{3}$, so powers decrease toward zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الحد الأول بنهاية المتتالية.","En":"Do not confuse the first term with the sequence limit."},"FormulaLatex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}r^n=0\\quad(|r|<1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{3}\\right)^n=0$","En":"$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{3}\\right)^n=0$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$0<\\left(\\frac1{3}\\right)^n\\le\\frac1{2^n}\\to0$","En":"$0<\\left(\\frac1{3}\\right)^n\\le\\frac1{2^n}\\to0$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"عامل الأساس كأنه أكبر من واحد مع أنه أصغر من واحد.","En":"Treats the base as greater than one although it is less than one."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"خلط الحد عند الأس صفر مع النهاية عند ازدياد الأس.","En":"Confuses the zeroth power with the limit at increasing exponent."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"أعطى قيمة الأساس أو الحد الأول بدلاً من نهاية القوى.","En":"Returns the base or first term instead of the limit of the powers."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قوى نسبة مطلقة أصغر من واحد تؤول إلى الصفر.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}r^n=0\quad(|r|<1)$

1. الأساس $r=\frac1{3}$ موجب وأصغر من الواحد.

2. كل حد ينتج عن ضرب سابقه في $\frac1{3}$، ولذلك تتناقص القوى إلى الصفر.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\left(\frac1{3}\right)^n=0$

$0$ بلا وحدة قياس

$0<\left(\frac1{3}\right)^n\le\frac1{2^n}\to0$

لا تخلط الحد الأول بنهاية المتتالية.$mw$,$mw$Powers of a ratio with magnitude below one tend to zero.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}r^n=0\quad(|r|<1)$

1. The base $r=\frac1{3}$ is positive and less than one.

2. Each term multiplies the preceding term by $\frac1{3}$, so powers decrease toward zero.

$\lim_{n\to\infty}\left(\frac1{3}\right)^n=0$

$0$ Dimensionless

$0<\left(\frac1{3}\right)^n\le\frac1{2^n}\to0$

Do not confuse the first term with the sequence limit.$mw$),
(559,353,$mw$72FE2A245FCE87B10635EADC62B469D74223E4E5C7D39A61B0CBD175A334BF56$mw$,$mw$9a8c895ebb6d28ebd5f7df3814ca5915$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":353,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=4x^2y+3y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (4،5).","TitleEn":"Given \\(f(x,y)=4x^2y+3y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (4,5).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=4x^2y+3y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (4،5).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(f(x,y)=4x^2y+3y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (4,5).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون المشتقة الجزئية بالنسبة إلى ص: نعامل س كثابت. للدالة f(س،ص) = 4س²ص + 3ص² نجد ∂f/∂ص = 4س² + 6ص. عند (4،5) نحسب 4 × 4² + 6 × 5 = 64 + 30 = 94.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Partial derivative with respect to y: Treat x as constant. For f(x,y)=4x²y+3y², ∂f/∂y=4x²+6y. At (4,5), calculate 4×4²+6×5=64+30=94.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1401,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"94","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1402,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"95","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1403,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"97","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1404,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"92","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المتغير المطلوب في المشتقة الجزئية.","En":"Identify the requested partial differentiation variable."},{"Ar":"اشتق التعبير مع تثبيت المتغير الآخر، ثم عوّض النقطة.","En":"Differentiate holding the other variable fixed, then evaluate at the point."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=4x^2y+3y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (4،5).","En":"Given \\(f(x,y)=4x^2y+3y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (4,5)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"94"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي الحد الأول $64$ والثاني $30$. القيمة $95$ تتطلب أن يكون مجموع الحدين مختلفاً بمقدار $1$، وهو خطأ في الاشتقاق أو التعويض.","En":"The first term gives $64$ and the second $30$. The choice $95$ differs from their sum by $1$, indicating a differentiation or substitution error."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"95"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي الحد الأول $64$ والثاني $30$. القيمة $97$ تتطلب أن يكون مجموع الحدين مختلفاً بمقدار $3$، وهو خطأ في الاشتقاق أو التعويض.","En":"The first term gives $64$ and the second $30$. The choice $97$ differs from their sum by $3$, indicating a differentiation or substitution error."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"97"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي الحد الأول $64$ والثاني $30$. القيمة $92$ تتطلب أن يكون مجموع الحدين مختلفاً بمقدار $-2$، وهو خطأ في الاشتقاق أو التعويض.","En":"The first term gives $64$ and the second $30$. The choice $92$ differs from their sum by $-2$, indicating a differentiation or substitution error."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"92"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا \\(f(x,y)=4x^2y+3y^2\\)، أوجد \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) عند (4،5).","En":"Given \\(f(x,y)=4x^2y+3y^2\\), evaluate \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) at (4,5)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض إحداثيي النقطة.","En":"Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then substitute the point."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى $y$، يبقى $x$ ثابتاً، ومشتقة $4x^2y$ هي $4x^2$.","En":"Holding $x$ fixed, differentiate $4x^2y$ in $y$ to get $4x^2$."},{"Ar":"مشتقة $3y^2$ هي $6y$. نجمع الحدين قبل التعويض.","En":"The derivative of $3y^2$ is $6y$. Add the terms before substitution."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$94$","En":"$94$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية قبل الاشتقاق.","En":"Do not substitute into the original function before differentiation."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}=4x^2+6y","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4(4)^2+6(5)=64+30=94$","En":"$4(4)^2+6(5)=64+30=94$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(4,5+h)-f(4,5)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(94+3h)=94$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(4,5+h)-f(4,5)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(94+3h)=94$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":57,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد المتغير المطلوب في المشتقة الجزئية.","En":"Identify the requested partial differentiation variable."},{"Ar":"اشتق التعبير مع تثبيت المتغير الآخر، ثم عوّض النقطة.","En":"Differentiate holding the other variable fixed, then evaluate at the point."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض إحداثيي النقطة.","En":"Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then substitute the point."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى $y$، يبقى $x$ ثابتاً، ومشتقة $4x^2y$ هي $4x^2$.","En":"Holding $x$ fixed, differentiate $4x^2y$ in $y$ to get $4x^2$."},{"Ar":"مشتقة $3y^2$ هي $6y$. نجمع الحدين قبل التعويض.","En":"The derivative of $3y^2$ is $6y$. Add the terms before substitution."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$94$","En":"$94$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية قبل الاشتقاق.","En":"Do not substitute into the original function before differentiation."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}=4x^2+6y","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4(4)^2+6(5)=64+30=94$","En":"$4(4)^2+6(5)=64+30=94$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(4,5+h)-f(4,5)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(94+3h)=94$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(4,5+h)-f(4,5)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(94+3h)=94$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي الحد الأول $64$ والثاني $30$. القيمة $95$ تتطلب أن يكون مجموع الحدين مختلفاً بمقدار $1$، وهو خطأ في الاشتقاق أو التعويض.","En":"The first term gives $64$ and the second $30$. The choice $95$ differs from their sum by $1$, indicating a differentiation or substitution error."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي الحد الأول $64$ والثاني $30$. القيمة $97$ تتطلب أن يكون مجموع الحدين مختلفاً بمقدار $3$، وهو خطأ في الاشتقاق أو التعويض.","En":"The first term gives $64$ and the second $30$. The choice $97$ differs from their sum by $3$, indicating a differentiation or substitution error."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"يعطي الحد الأول $64$ والثاني $30$. القيمة $92$ تتطلب أن يكون مجموع الحدين مختلفاً بمقدار $-2$، وهو خطأ في الاشتقاق أو التعويض.","En":"The first term gives $64$ and the second $30$. The choice $92$ differs from their sum by $-2$, indicating a differentiation or substitution error."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نثبت x عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى y ثم نعوض إحداثيي النقطة.

$\frac{\partial f}{\partial y}=4x^2+6y$

1. عند الاشتقاق بالنسبة إلى $y$، يبقى $x$ ثابتاً، ومشتقة $4x^2y$ هي $4x^2$.

2. مشتقة $3y^2$ هي $6y$. نجمع الحدين قبل التعويض.

$4(4)^2+6(5)=64+30=94$

$94$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(4,5+h)-f(4,5)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(94+3h)=94$

لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية قبل الاشتقاق.$mw$,$mw$Hold x fixed when differentiating in y, then substitute the point.

$\frac{\partial f}{\partial y}=4x^2+6y$

1. Holding $x$ fixed, differentiate $4x^2y$ in $y$ to get $4x^2$.

2. The derivative of $3y^2$ is $6y$. Add the terms before substitution.

$4(4)^2+6(5)=64+30=94$

$94$ Dimensionless

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(4,5+h)-f(4,5)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(94+3h)=94$

Do not substitute into the original function before differentiation.$mw$),
(560,354,$mw$8C011627C925924657B6F989D743ABEBCF2C3DD87A7E9D45DA3346184C0FD25D$mw$,$mw$2701a6fa98a89c66fb99fe32c2589693$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":354,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (4،5)؟","TitleEn":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (4,5).","QuestionTextAr":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (4،5)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (4,5).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون التدرج: ∇f(س،ص) = (∂f/∂س،∂f/∂ص). للدالة f(س،ص) = س² + ص²، التدرج هو (2س،2ص). عند النقطة (4،5) تصبح المركبتان (2 × 4،2 × 5) = (8،10). هذا متجه وليس عدداً واحداً.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Gradient rule: ∇f=(∂f/∂x,∂f/∂y). For f(x,y)=x²+y², ∇f=(2x,2y). At (4,5), the result is (2×4,2×5)=(8,10). A gradient is a vector, not a scalar.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1405,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(4,5)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1406,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(10,8)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1407,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(8,-10)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1408,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(8,10)","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب المشتقتين الجزئيتين.","En":"Compute both partial derivatives."},{"Ar":"رتب مشتقة x أولاً ومشتقة y ثانياً، ثم عوض النقطة.","En":"Order the x-partial first and y-partial second, then evaluate."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (4،5)؟","En":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (4,5)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"أعاد إحداثيي النقطة دون اشتقاق.","En":"Returns the input coordinates without differentiation."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(4,5)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المشتقتين الجزئيتين.","En":"Swaps the two partial derivatives."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(10,8)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"غيّر إشارة المركبة الثانية مع أن الإحداثي الثاني موجب ومشتقته تساوي ضعفه.","En":"Negates the second component even though the positive y-coordinate yields a positive derivative."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(8,-10)"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"(8,10)"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما تدرج \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) عند النقطة (4،5)؟","En":"Find gradient of \\(f(x,y)=x^2+y^2\\) at (4,5)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التدرج متجه يجمع المشتقتين الجزئيتين بالترتيب.","En":"The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نشتق $x^2+y^2$ بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$، فنحصل على $2x$.","En":"Differentiate $x^2+y^2$ in $x$ with $y$ fixed, giving $2x$."},{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نرتب المركبتين بهذا الترتيب.","En":"Differentiate in $y$ with $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain this component order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(8,10)$","En":"$(8,10)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدل ترتيب مركبتي التدرج.","En":"Do not swap gradient components."},"FormulaLatex":"\\nabla f=(2x,2y)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\nabla f(4,5)=(2\\cdot4,2\\cdot5)=(8,10)$","En":"$\\nabla f(4,5)=(2\\cdot4,2\\cdot5)=(8,10)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f_x(4,5)=8,\\quad f_y(4,5)=10$","En":"$f_x(4,5)=8,\\quad f_y(4,5)=10$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":59,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب المشتقتين الجزئيتين.","En":"Compute both partial derivatives."},{"Ar":"رتب مشتقة x أولاً ومشتقة y ثانياً، ثم عوض النقطة.","En":"Order the x-partial first and y-partial second, then evaluate."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التدرج متجه يجمع المشتقتين الجزئيتين بالترتيب.","En":"The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نشتق $x^2+y^2$ بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$، فنحصل على $2x$.","En":"Differentiate $x^2+y^2$ in $x$ with $y$ fixed, giving $2x$."},{"Ar":"نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نرتب المركبتين بهذا الترتيب.","En":"Differentiate in $y$ with $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain this component order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(8,10)$","En":"$(8,10)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدل ترتيب مركبتي التدرج.","En":"Do not swap gradient components."},"FormulaLatex":"\\nabla f=(2x,2y)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\nabla f(4,5)=(2\\cdot4,2\\cdot5)=(8,10)$","En":"$\\nabla f(4,5)=(2\\cdot4,2\\cdot5)=(8,10)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f_x(4,5)=8,\\quad f_y(4,5)=10$","En":"$f_x(4,5)=8,\\quad f_y(4,5)=10$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"أعاد إحداثيي النقطة دون اشتقاق.","En":"Returns the input coordinates without differentiation."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المشتقتين الجزئيتين.","En":"Swaps the two partial derivatives."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"غيّر إشارة المركبة الثانية مع أن الإحداثي الثاني موجب ومشتقته تساوي ضعفه.","En":"Negates the second component even though the positive y-coordinate yields a positive derivative."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التدرج متجه يجمع المشتقتين الجزئيتين بالترتيب.

$\nabla f=(2x,2y)$

1. نشتق $x^2+y^2$ بالنسبة إلى $x$ مع تثبيت $y$، فنحصل على $2x$.

2. نشتق بالنسبة إلى $y$ مع تثبيت $x$ فنحصل على $2y$؛ نرتب المركبتين بهذا الترتيب.

$\nabla f(4,5)=(2\cdot4,2\cdot5)=(8,10)$

$(8,10)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$f_x(4,5)=8,\quad f_y(4,5)=10$

لا تبدل ترتيب مركبتي التدرج.$mw$,$mw$The gradient is the ordered vector of partial derivatives.

$\nabla f=(2x,2y)$

1. Differentiate $x^2+y^2$ in $x$ with $y$ fixed, giving $2x$.

2. Differentiate in $y$ with $x$ fixed to get $2y$; retain this component order.

$\nabla f(4,5)=(2\cdot4,2\cdot5)=(8,10)$

$(8,10)$ Dimensionless

$f_x(4,5)=8,\quad f_y(4,5)=10$

Do not swap gradient components.$mw$),
(561,355,$mw$15E839BC8367D6902D722D1CBB278909A6D4D159CB865D3CC842126F7DC6D66B$mw$,$mw$4a529862bd0e1d76d9e747eab69c37a8$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":355,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":13,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (3،4) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","TitleEn":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (3,4) in positive x-direction.","QuestionTextAr":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (3،4) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","QuestionTextEn":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (3,4) in positive x-direction.","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون المشتقة الاتجاهية في اتجاه وحدة u: Dᵤf = ∇f · u. للدالة f(س،ص) = س² + 3ص² يكون ∇f = (2س،6ص). اتجاه س الموجب يساوي متجه الوحدة u=(1،0)، لذا Dᵤf = 2س × 1 + 6ص × 0 = 2س. عند (3،4) الناتج 6.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Directional derivative: D_u f = ∇f · u for a unit direction u. For f(x,y)=x²+3y², ∇f=(2x,6y). The positive x-direction is u=(1,0), so D_u f=2x×1+6y×0=2x. At (3,4), this equals 6.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1409,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1410,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1411,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1412,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد متجه وحدة الاتجاه الموجب لمحور x.","En":"Identify the positive x-axis unit direction."},{"Ar":"احسب التدرج عند النقطة ثم اضربه قياسياً في متجه الاتجاه.","En":"Evaluate the gradient at the point and dot it with the direction."}],"Title":{"Ar":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (3،4) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","En":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (3,4) in positive x-direction."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"في الاتجاه $(1,0)$ تكون مساهمة المركبة الرأسية صفراً. القيمة $9$ لا تساوي المركبة الأفقية $2\\cdot3$؛ راجع حساب الإسقاط.","En":"In direction $(1,0)$ the vertical contribution is zero. The choice $9$ is not the horizontal component $2\\cdot3$; recheck the projection."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"في الاتجاه $(1,0)$ تكون مساهمة المركبة الرأسية صفراً. القيمة $4$ لا تساوي المركبة الأفقية $2\\cdot3$؛ راجع حساب الإسقاط.","En":"In direction $(1,0)$ the vertical contribution is zero. The choice $4$ is not the horizontal component $2\\cdot3$; recheck the projection."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"في الاتجاه $(1,0)$ تكون مساهمة المركبة الرأسية صفراً. القيمة $7$ لا تساوي المركبة الأفقية $2\\cdot3$؛ راجع حساب الإسقاط.","En":"In direction $(1,0)$ the vertical contribution is zero. The choice $7$ is not the horizontal component $2\\cdot3$; recheck the projection."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"7"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"لدالة \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\)، احسب المشتقة الاتجاهية عند (3،4) باتجاه محور x الموجب.","En":"For \\(f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2\\), find directional derivative at (3,4) in positive x-direction."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.","En":"The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المشتقتان الجزئيتان هما $2x$ و$6y$؛ الاتجاه الموجب لمحور $x$ متجه وحدته $(1,0)$.","En":"The partial derivatives are $2x$ and $6y$; the positive x-direction has unit vector $(1,0)$."},{"Ar":"التدرج عند النقطة يساوي $(6,24)$، والجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.","En":"The gradient at the point is $(6,24)$; the dot product selects its first component."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.","En":"Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection."},"FormulaLatex":"D_{\\mathbf u}f=\\nabla f\\cdot\\mathbf u,\\quad \\mathbf u=(1,0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(6,24)\\cdot(1,0)=6+0=6$","En":"$(6,24)\\cdot(1,0)=6+0=6$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(3+h,4)-f(3,4)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(6+h)=6$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(3+h,4)-f(3,4)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(6+h)=6$"}},"TrackIds":[13,21],"CategoryId":13,"PrimarySkillId":60,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد متجه وحدة الاتجاه الموجب لمحور x.","En":"Identify the positive x-axis unit direction."},{"Ar":"احسب التدرج عند النقطة ثم اضربه قياسياً في متجه الاتجاه.","En":"Evaluate the gradient at the point and dot it with the direction."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.","En":"The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المشتقتان الجزئيتان هما $2x$ و$6y$؛ الاتجاه الموجب لمحور $x$ متجه وحدته $(1,0)$.","En":"The partial derivatives are $2x$ and $6y$; the positive x-direction has unit vector $(1,0)$."},{"Ar":"التدرج عند النقطة يساوي $(6,24)$، والجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.","En":"The gradient at the point is $(6,24)$; the dot product selects its first component."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.","En":"Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection."},"FormulaLatex":"D_{\\mathbf u}f=\\nabla f\\cdot\\mathbf u,\\quad \\mathbf u=(1,0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(6,24)\\cdot(1,0)=6+0=6$","En":"$(6,24)\\cdot(1,0)=6+0=6$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(3+h,4)-f(3,4)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(6+h)=6$","En":"$\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{f(3+h,4)-f(3,4)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0}(6+h)=6$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"في الاتجاه $(1,0)$ تكون مساهمة المركبة الرأسية صفراً. القيمة $9$ لا تساوي المركبة الأفقية $2\\cdot3$؛ راجع حساب الإسقاط.","En":"In direction $(1,0)$ the vertical contribution is zero. The choice $9$ is not the horizontal component $2\\cdot3$; recheck the projection."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"في الاتجاه $(1,0)$ تكون مساهمة المركبة الرأسية صفراً. القيمة $4$ لا تساوي المركبة الأفقية $2\\cdot3$؛ راجع حساب الإسقاط.","En":"In direction $(1,0)$ the vertical contribution is zero. The choice $4$ is not the horizontal component $2\\cdot3$; recheck the projection."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"في الاتجاه $(1,0)$ تكون مساهمة المركبة الرأسية صفراً. القيمة $7$ لا تساوي المركبة الأفقية $2\\cdot3$؛ راجع حساب الإسقاط.","En":"In direction $(1,0)$ the vertical contribution is zero. The choice $7$ is not the horizontal component $2\\cdot3$; recheck the projection."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المشتقة الاتجاهية هي الضرب القياسي للتدرج بمتجه وحدة الاتجاه.

$D_{\mathbf u}f=\nabla f\cdot\mathbf u,\quad \mathbf u=(1,0)$

1. المشتقتان الجزئيتان هما $2x$ و$6y$؛ الاتجاه الموجب لمحور $x$ متجه وحدته $(1,0)$.

2. التدرج عند النقطة يساوي $(6,24)$، والجداء النقطي ينتقي المركبة الأولى.

$(6,24)\cdot(1,0)=6+0=6$

$6$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(3+h,4)-f(3,4)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(6+h)=6$

لا تستخدم معيار التدرج بدلاً من إسقاطه الاتجاهي.$mw$,$mw$The directional derivative is the gradient dotted with the unit direction vector.

$D_{\mathbf u}f=\nabla f\cdot\mathbf u,\quad \mathbf u=(1,0)$

1. The partial derivatives are $2x$ and $6y$; the positive x-direction has unit vector $(1,0)$.

2. The gradient at the point is $(6,24)$; the dot product selects its first component.

$(6,24)\cdot(1,0)=6+0=6$

$6$ Dimensionless

$\lim_{h\to0}\frac{f(3+h,4)-f(3,4)}{h}=\lim_{h\to0}(6+h)=6$

Do not use the gradient norm instead of its directional projection.$mw$),
(562,356,$mw$00DE03A197CFAE27AF54B084B6FC41FEDB501994EB4A250B19EED4E66CD34E5D$mw$,$mw$ea245fb4670edde34a6b2d7e9b31e477$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":356,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":14,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما أثر المصفوفة \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","TitleEn":"Find trace of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"ما أثر المصفوفة \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find trace of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"تعريف أثر المصفوفة المربعة tr(A): مجموع عناصر القطر الرئيسي من أعلى اليسار إلى أسفل اليمين. المصفوفة المعطاة قطرها الرئيسي 4 و6، لذا tr(A) = 4 + 6 = 10. لا نخلط بين الأثر والمحدد، فالعمليتان مختلفتان.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Trace of a square matrix is the sum of its main diagonal entries. Here the main diagonal contains 4 and 6, so tr(A) = 4 + 6 = 10. The trace is not the determinant.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1413,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1414,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1415,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1416,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد القطر الرئيسي.","En":"Identify the main diagonal."},{"Ar":"اجمع عناصر القطر الرئيسي فقط.","En":"Sum only the main diagonal entries."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما أثر المصفوفة \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","En":"Find trace of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"الأثر يضم العنصرين $4$ و$6$ فقط. القيمة $11$ أكبر من مجموعهما بمقدار $1$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر إضافية.","En":"Trace uses only $4$ and $6$. The choice $11$ is 1 above their sum; recheck the addition without introducing extra entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الأثر يضم العنصرين $4$ و$6$ فقط. القيمة $13$ أكبر من مجموعهما بمقدار $3$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر إضافية.","En":"Trace uses only $4$ and $6$. The choice $13$ is 3 above their sum; recheck the addition without introducing extra entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"13"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الأثر يضم العنصرين $4$ و$6$ فقط. القيمة $8$ أصغر من مجموعهما بمقدار $2$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر إضافية.","En":"Trace uses only $4$ and $6$. The choice $8$ is 2 below their sum; recheck the addition without introducing extra entries."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما أثر المصفوفة \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","En":"Find trace of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&0\\\\0&6\\end{pmatrix}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"أثر المصفوفة مجموع عناصر القطر الرئيسي.","En":"Matrix trace is the sum of the main diagonal entries."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عنصرا القطر الرئيسي هما $4$ و$6$؛ العنصران خارج القطر صفران.","En":"The main diagonal entries are $4$ and $6$; the off-diagonal entries are zero."},{"Ar":"الأثر هو مجموع عنصري القطر وليس حاصل ضربهما.","En":"The trace is their sum, not their product."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الأثر بالمحدد.","En":"Do not confuse trace with determinant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{tr}(A)=a_{11}+a_{22}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4+6=10$","En":"$4+6=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\operatorname{tr}(A)=6+4=10$","En":"$\\operatorname{tr}(A)=6+4=10$"}},"TrackIds":[14,20],"CategoryId":14,"PrimarySkillId":64,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد القطر الرئيسي.","En":"Identify the main diagonal."},{"Ar":"اجمع عناصر القطر الرئيسي فقط.","En":"Sum only the main diagonal entries."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"أثر المصفوفة مجموع عناصر القطر الرئيسي.","En":"Matrix trace is the sum of the main diagonal entries."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عنصرا القطر الرئيسي هما $4$ و$6$؛ العنصران خارج القطر صفران.","En":"The main diagonal entries are $4$ and $6$; the off-diagonal entries are zero."},{"Ar":"الأثر هو مجموع عنصري القطر وليس حاصل ضربهما.","En":"The trace is their sum, not their product."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط الأثر بالمحدد.","En":"Do not confuse trace with determinant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{tr}(A)=a_{11}+a_{22}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4+6=10$","En":"$4+6=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\operatorname{tr}(A)=6+4=10$","En":"$\\operatorname{tr}(A)=6+4=10$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الأثر يضم العنصرين $4$ و$6$ فقط. القيمة $11$ أكبر من مجموعهما بمقدار $1$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر إضافية.","En":"Trace uses only $4$ and $6$. The choice $11$ is 1 above their sum; recheck the addition without introducing extra entries."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الأثر يضم العنصرين $4$ و$6$ فقط. القيمة $13$ أكبر من مجموعهما بمقدار $3$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر إضافية.","En":"Trace uses only $4$ and $6$. The choice $13$ is 3 above their sum; recheck the addition without introducing extra entries."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"الأثر يضم العنصرين $4$ و$6$ فقط. القيمة $8$ أصغر من مجموعهما بمقدار $2$؛ راجع الجمع دون إدخال عناصر إضافية.","En":"Trace uses only $4$ and $6$. The choice $8$ is 2 below their sum; recheck the addition without introducing extra entries."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$أثر المصفوفة مجموع عناصر القطر الرئيسي.

$\operatorname{tr}(A)=a_{11}+a_{22}$

1. عنصرا القطر الرئيسي هما $4$ و$6$؛ العنصران خارج القطر صفران.

2. الأثر هو مجموع عنصري القطر وليس حاصل ضربهما.

$4+6=10$

$10$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\operatorname{tr}(A)=6+4=10$

لا تخلط الأثر بالمحدد.$mw$,$mw$Matrix trace is the sum of the main diagonal entries.

$\operatorname{tr}(A)=a_{11}+a_{22}$

1. The main diagonal entries are $4$ and $6$; the off-diagonal entries are zero.

2. The trace is their sum, not their product.

$4+6=10$

$10$ Dimensionless

$\operatorname{tr}(A)=6+4=10$

Do not confuse trace with determinant.$mw$),
(563,357,$mw$10E038B50A091B8B01104DF93071C2C6C1743C9730CFD5EAC2FB78E0F7C483A5$mw$,$mw$4e39bd562dcb674028957c090c1d0697$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":357,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":14,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"اضرب المتجه (5،6) بالعدد 4.","TitleEn":"Multiply vector (5,6) by scalar 4.","QuestionTextAr":"اضرب المتجه (5،6) بالعدد 4.","QuestionTextEn":"Multiply vector (5,6) by scalar 4.","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون ضرب المتجه بعدد حقيقي: k(أ،ب) = (kأ، kب). عند ضرب المتجه (5،6) في العدد 4 نضرب كل مركبة مستقلة: (4×5، 4×6) = (20،24). لا نجمع المركبتين، لأن الناتج متجه ذو مركبتين.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Scalar-vector multiplication: k(a,b)=(ka,kb). Multiplying (5,6) by 4 scales each component: (4×5,4×6)=(20,24). The result remains a two-component vector.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1417,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(24,20)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1418,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(5,24)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1419,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(20,24)","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1420,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(9,10)","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد العامل العددي.","En":"Identify the scalar."},{"Ar":"اضرب كل مركبة بالعامل مع حفظ الترتيب.","En":"Multiply both components by the scalar in order."}],"Title":{"Ar":"اضرب المتجه (5،6) بالعدد 4.","En":"Multiply vector (5,6) by scalar 4."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المركبتين بعد ضربهما.","En":"Reverses the components after scaling."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(24,20)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"ضرب المركبة الثانية فقط وأبقى الأولى دون تغيير.","En":"Scales only the second component and leaves the first unchanged."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(5,24)"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"(20,24)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"جمع العامل مع المركبتين بدلاً من الضرب.","En":"Adds the scalar to each component instead of multiplying."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(9,10)"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"اضرب المتجه (5،6) بالعدد 4.","En":"Multiply vector (5,6) by scalar 4."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب العددي يضرب كل مركبة بالعامل نفسه.","En":"Scalar multiplication scales each component by the same factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب المركبة الأولى $5$ في العامل $4$ فنحصل على $20$.","En":"Multiply first component $5$ by scalar $4$ to get $20$."},{"Ar":"نضرب المركبة الثانية $6$ في العامل نفسه فنحصل على $24$، ونحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.","En":"Multiply second component $6$ by the same scalar to get $24$, preserving order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(20,24)$","En":"$(20,24)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضف العامل أو تبدل المركبات.","En":"Do not add the scalar or swap components."},"FormulaLatex":"k(a,b)=(ka,kb)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4(5,6)=(4\\cdot5,4\\cdot6)=(20,24)$","En":"$4(5,6)=(4\\cdot5,4\\cdot6)=(20,24)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(20/4,24/4)=(5,6)$","En":"$(20/4,24/4)=(5,6)$"}},"TrackIds":[14,20],"CategoryId":14,"PrimarySkillId":65,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد العامل العددي.","En":"Identify the scalar."},{"Ar":"اضرب كل مركبة بالعامل مع حفظ الترتيب.","En":"Multiply both components by the scalar in order."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب العددي يضرب كل مركبة بالعامل نفسه.","En":"Scalar multiplication scales each component by the same factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب المركبة الأولى $5$ في العامل $4$ فنحصل على $20$.","En":"Multiply first component $5$ by scalar $4$ to get $20$."},{"Ar":"نضرب المركبة الثانية $6$ في العامل نفسه فنحصل على $24$، ونحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.","En":"Multiply second component $6$ by the same scalar to get $24$, preserving order."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(20,24)$","En":"$(20,24)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضف العامل أو تبدل المركبات.","En":"Do not add the scalar or swap components."},"FormulaLatex":"k(a,b)=(ka,kb)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4(5,6)=(4\\cdot5,4\\cdot6)=(20,24)$","En":"$4(5,6)=(4\\cdot5,4\\cdot6)=(20,24)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(20/4,24/4)=(5,6)$","En":"$(20/4,24/4)=(5,6)$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بدّل ترتيب المركبتين بعد ضربهما.","En":"Reverses the components after scaling."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"ضرب المركبة الثانية فقط وأبقى الأولى دون تغيير.","En":"Scales only the second component and leaves the first unchanged."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"جمع العامل مع المركبتين بدلاً من الضرب.","En":"Adds the scalar to each component instead of multiplying."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الضرب العددي يضرب كل مركبة بالعامل نفسه.

$k(a,b)=(ka,kb)$

1. نضرب المركبة الأولى $5$ في العامل $4$ فنحصل على $20$.

2. نضرب المركبة الثانية $6$ في العامل نفسه فنحصل على $24$، ونحافظ على ترتيب المركبتين.

$4(5,6)=(4\cdot5,4\cdot6)=(20,24)$

$(20,24)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(20/4,24/4)=(5,6)$

لا تضف العامل أو تبدل المركبات.$mw$,$mw$Scalar multiplication scales each component by the same factor.

$k(a,b)=(ka,kb)$

1. Multiply first component $5$ by scalar $4$ to get $20$.

2. Multiply second component $6$ by the same scalar to get $24$, preserving order.

$4(5,6)=(4\cdot5,4\cdot6)=(20,24)$

$(20,24)$ Dimensionless

$(20/4,24/4)=(5,6)$

Do not add the scalar or swap components.$mw$),
(564,358,$mw$BC38BA5FDDBBB72783B4124BA8A88329E64A8EECD71AAD2764D035232BAD1C42$mw$,$mw$23a314247837663b6211b4cff6426193$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":358,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":14,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"ما محدد \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&5\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","TitleEn":"Find determinant of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&5\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"ما محدد \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&5\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find determinant of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&5\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قاعدة المحدد للمصفوفة المثلثية: حاصل ضرب عناصر القطر الرئيسي. للمصفوفة [[4،5],[0،7]] نحسب det = 4×7 − 5×0 = 4×7 = 28. وجود صفر تحت القطر يبسط القانون، فلا تسهم القيمة 5 في الحد المطروح.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Triangular matrix determinant equals the product of the main diagonal entries. For [[4,5],[0,7]], det=4×7−5×0=4×7=28. The zero below the diagonal removes the second product.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1421,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"26","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1422,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"28","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1423,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"29","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1424,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"31","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ العنصر الصفري تحت القطر.","En":"Notice the zero below the diagonal."},{"Ar":"احسب جداء القطر الرئيسي واطرح جداء القطر الآخر.","En":"Multiply the diagonal entries and subtract the other diagonal product."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما محدد \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&5\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","En":"Find determinant of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&5\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"لأن المصفوفة مثلثية، لا يؤثر العنصر $5$ خارج القطر على المحدد. القيمة $26$ تختلف عن جداء القطر بمقدار $-2$؛ راجع ضرب العنصرين.","En":"Because the matrix is triangular, off-diagonal entry $5$ does not affect the determinant. The choice $26$ differs from the diagonal product by $-2$; recheck the multiplication."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"26"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"28"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"لأن المصفوفة مثلثية، لا يؤثر العنصر $5$ خارج القطر على المحدد. القيمة $29$ تختلف عن جداء القطر بمقدار $1$؛ راجع ضرب العنصرين.","En":"Because the matrix is triangular, off-diagonal entry $5$ does not affect the determinant. The choice $29$ differs from the diagonal product by $1$; recheck the multiplication."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"29"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"لأن المصفوفة مثلثية، لا يؤثر العنصر $5$ خارج القطر على المحدد. القيمة $31$ تختلف عن جداء القطر بمقدار $3$؛ راجع ضرب العنصرين.","En":"Because the matrix is triangular, off-diagonal entry $5$ does not affect the determinant. The choice $31$ differs from the diagonal product by $3$; recheck the multiplication."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"31"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"ما محدد \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&5\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)؟","En":"Find determinant of \\(\\begin{pmatrix}4&5\\\\0&7\\end{pmatrix}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المحدد الثنائي فرق جداءي القطرين؛ في المثلثية يساوي جداء القطر الرئيسي.","En":"A two-by-two determinant subtracts the off-diagonal product; for triangular matrices it is the main diagonal product."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"جداء القطر الرئيسي هو $4\\cdot7=28$.","En":"The main diagonal product is $4\\cdot7=28$."},{"Ar":"جداء القطر الآخر هو $5\\cdot0=0$؛ نطرح هذا الجداء من الأول.","En":"The other diagonal product is $5\\cdot0=0$; subtract it from the first."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$28$","En":"$28$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع عناصر القطر بدلاً من ضربها.","En":"Do not add diagonal entries instead of multiplying."},"FormulaLatex":"\\det\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}=ad-bc","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4\\cdot7-5\\cdot0=28$","En":"$4\\cdot7-5\\cdot0=28$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"المصفوفة مثلثية علوية، ومحدد المصفوفة المثلثية حاصل ضرب عناصر قطرها الرئيسي، وهو 28.","En":"The matrix is upper triangular; its determinant is the product of diagonal entries, 28."}},"TrackIds":[14,20],"CategoryId":14,"PrimarySkillId":61,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ العنصر الصفري تحت القطر.","En":"Notice the zero below the diagonal."},{"Ar":"احسب جداء القطر الرئيسي واطرح جداء القطر الآخر.","En":"Multiply the diagonal entries and subtract the other diagonal product."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المحدد الثنائي فرق جداءي القطرين؛ في المثلثية يساوي جداء القطر الرئيسي.","En":"A two-by-two determinant subtracts the off-diagonal product; for triangular matrices it is the main diagonal product."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"جداء القطر الرئيسي هو $4\\cdot7=28$.","En":"The main diagonal product is $4\\cdot7=28$."},{"Ar":"جداء القطر الآخر هو $5\\cdot0=0$؛ نطرح هذا الجداء من الأول.","En":"The other diagonal product is $5\\cdot0=0$; subtract it from the first."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$28$","En":"$28$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تجمع عناصر القطر بدلاً من ضربها.","En":"Do not add diagonal entries instead of multiplying."},"FormulaLatex":"\\det\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}=ad-bc","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4\\cdot7-5\\cdot0=28$","En":"$4\\cdot7-5\\cdot0=28$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"المصفوفة مثلثية علوية، ومحدد المصفوفة المثلثية حاصل ضرب عناصر قطرها الرئيسي، وهو 28.","En":"The matrix is upper triangular; its determinant is the product of diagonal entries, 28."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"لأن المصفوفة مثلثية، لا يؤثر العنصر $5$ خارج القطر على المحدد. القيمة $26$ تختلف عن جداء القطر بمقدار $-2$؛ راجع ضرب العنصرين.","En":"Because the matrix is triangular, off-diagonal entry $5$ does not affect the determinant. The choice $26$ differs from the diagonal product by $-2$; recheck the multiplication."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"لأن المصفوفة مثلثية، لا يؤثر العنصر $5$ خارج القطر على المحدد. القيمة $29$ تختلف عن جداء القطر بمقدار $1$؛ راجع ضرب العنصرين.","En":"Because the matrix is triangular, off-diagonal entry $5$ does not affect the determinant. The choice $29$ differs from the diagonal product by $1$; recheck the multiplication."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"لأن المصفوفة مثلثية، لا يؤثر العنصر $5$ خارج القطر على المحدد. القيمة $31$ تختلف عن جداء القطر بمقدار $3$؛ راجع ضرب العنصرين.","En":"Because the matrix is triangular, off-diagonal entry $5$ does not affect the determinant. The choice $31$ differs from the diagonal product by $3$; recheck the multiplication."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المحدد الثنائي فرق جداءي القطرين؛ في المثلثية يساوي جداء القطر الرئيسي.

$\det\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\c&d\end{pmatrix}=ad-bc$

1. جداء القطر الرئيسي هو $4\cdot7=28$.

2. جداء القطر الآخر هو $5\cdot0=0$؛ نطرح هذا الجداء من الأول.

$4\cdot7-5\cdot0=28$

$28$ بلا وحدة قياس

المصفوفة مثلثية علوية، ومحدد المصفوفة المثلثية حاصل ضرب عناصر قطرها الرئيسي، وهو 28.

لا تجمع عناصر القطر بدلاً من ضربها.$mw$,$mw$A two-by-two determinant subtracts the off-diagonal product; for triangular matrices it is the main diagonal product.

$\det\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\c&d\end{pmatrix}=ad-bc$

1. The main diagonal product is $4\cdot7=28$.

2. The other diagonal product is $5\cdot0=0$; subtract it from the first.

$4\cdot7-5\cdot0=28$

$28$ Dimensionless

The matrix is upper triangular; its determinant is the product of diagonal entries, 28.

Do not add diagonal entries instead of multiplying.$mw$),
(565,359,$mw$3C9AE4B084EC6743083E43F1D23C751C1DBB3F31E29E6DEFC04B384F3E8C2885$mw$,$mw$6e6488588dd43b5fb62d98fa334873c7$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":359,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":15,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(y'=5\\) و\\(y(0)=4\\)، أوجد \\(y(6)\\).","TitleEn":"Given \\(y'=5\\), \\(y(0)=4\\), find \\(y(6)\\).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(y'=5\\) و\\(y(0)=4\\)، أوجد \\(y(6)\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(y'=5\\), \\(y(0)=4\\), find \\(y(6)\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قاعدة التكامل: إذا كانت y′ = 5 ثابتة، فالدالة y(x) = 5x + C. باستخدام y(0) = 4 نحصل على C = 4. بالتعويض عند x = 6: ‏y(6) = 5 × 6 + 4 = 34. التحقق: مشتقة 5x + 4 هي 5، ويحقق الشرط الابتدائي.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Integration rule: If y′ = 5 is constant, then y(x) = 5x + C. From y(0) = 4, we obtain C = 4. Evaluate at x = 6: y(6) = 5 × 6 + 4 = 34. The derivative is 5, and y(0) agrees with the initial value.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1425,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"37","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1426,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"32","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1427,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"34","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1428,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"35","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بتكامل الطرف الأيمن.","En":"Start by integrating the right side."},{"Ar":"حدد الثابت من قيمة y عند الصفر ثم عوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Find the constant from y at zero, then evaluate the requested input."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y'=5\\) و\\(y(0)=4\\)، أوجد \\(y(6)\\).","En":"Given \\(y'=5\\), \\(y(0)=4\\), find \\(y(6)\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $30$، فإن اختيار $37$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $7$ بدلاً من $4$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $30$, choice $37$ would require initial value $7$ rather than $4$, violating the condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"37"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $30$، فإن اختيار $32$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $2$ بدلاً من $4$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $30$, choice $32$ would require initial value $2$ rather than $4$, violating the condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"32"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"34"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $30$، فإن اختيار $35$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $5$ بدلاً من $4$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $30$, choice $35$ would require initial value $5$ rather than $4$, violating the condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"35"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y'=5\\) و\\(y(0)=4\\)، أوجد \\(y(6)\\).","En":"Given \\(y'=5\\), \\(y(0)=4\\), find \\(y(6)\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نكامل الطرف الأيمن فنحصل على $y=5x+C$.","En":"Integrate the right-hand side to obtain $y=5x+C$."},{"Ar":"من $y(0)=4$ نجد $C=4$، فنعوض $x=6$ في الحل.","En":"From $y(0)=4$ we get $C=4$, then substitute $x=6$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$34$","En":"$34$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Do not omit the initial condition."},"FormulaLatex":"y(x)=y(0)+\\int_0^x g(t)\\,dt","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(6)=5(6)+4=30+4=34$","En":"$y(6)=5(6)+4=30+4=34$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(5x+4)'=5,\\quad y(0)=4$","En":"$(5x+4)'=5,\\quad y(0)=4$"}},"TrackIds":[15,21],"CategoryId":15,"PrimarySkillId":68,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بتكامل الطرف الأيمن.","En":"Start by integrating the right side."},{"Ar":"حدد الثابت من قيمة y عند الصفر ثم عوض المدخل المطلوب.","En":"Find the constant from y at zero, then evaluate the requested input."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نكامل الطرف الأيمن فنحصل على $y=5x+C$.","En":"Integrate the right-hand side to obtain $y=5x+C$."},{"Ar":"من $y(0)=4$ نجد $C=4$، فنعوض $x=6$ في الحل.","En":"From $y(0)=4$ we get $C=4$, then substitute $x=6$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$34$","En":"$34$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Do not omit the initial condition."},"FormulaLatex":"y(x)=y(0)+\\int_0^x g(t)\\,dt","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(6)=5(6)+4=30+4=34$","En":"$y(6)=5(6)+4=30+4=34$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(5x+4)'=5,\\quad y(0)=4$","En":"$(5x+4)'=5,\\quad y(0)=4$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $30$، فإن اختيار $37$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $7$ بدلاً من $4$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $30$, choice $37$ would require initial value $7$ rather than $4$, violating the condition."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $30$، فإن اختيار $32$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $2$ بدلاً من $4$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $30$, choice $32$ would require initial value $2$ rather than $4$, violating the condition."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $30$، فإن اختيار $35$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $5$ بدلاً من $4$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $30$, choice $35$ would require initial value $5$ rather than $4$, violating the condition."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نستعيد الدالة بتكامل مشتقتها واستعمال الشرط الابتدائي.

$y(x)=y(0)+\int_0^x g(t)\,dt$

1. نكامل الطرف الأيمن فنحصل على $y=5x+C$.

2. من $y(0)=4$ نجد $C=4$، فنعوض $x=6$ في الحل.

$y(6)=5(6)+4=30+4=34$

$34$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(5x+4)'=5,\quad y(0)=4$

لا تهمل الشرط الابتدائي.$mw$,$mw$Recover the function by integrating its derivative and applying the initial condition.

$y(x)=y(0)+\int_0^x g(t)\,dt$

1. Integrate the right-hand side to obtain $y=5x+C$.

2. From $y(0)=4$ we get $C=4$, then substitute $x=6$.

$y(6)=5(6)+4=30+4=34$

$34$ Dimensionless

$(5x+4)'=5,\quad y(0)=4$

Do not omit the initial condition.$mw$);
